WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-That's a crowd right there!
-Come on!

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:05.071
-Waking everyone up! Wake up!

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.440
And welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.476
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.679
I appreciate it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:15.714
Well, guys, today the
White House announced a new way

00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:17.917
that they're trying to get
more Americans vaccinated.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.252
Listen to this.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:21.654
-Some of America's biggest
dating apps are joining

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.090
the White House push
to get Americans vaccinated.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:28.094
Apps including Tinder, Hinge
and Bumble will offer badges

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.930
for singles to display
their vaccination status.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.865
-Wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:34.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.569
Sure.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.070
That's great.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.873
The only other shot dating apps
ever promoted was Penicillin,

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.909
so I think that's a great --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.911
I like the idea.
You get your shots,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.180
you meet someone on Tinder,
then get a few more shots.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.148
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.350
Usually when you hear
"White House" and "Tinder"

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.519
in the same sentence,

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:54.653
it's followed by
"resignation" and "disgrace."

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:56.723
You know what I'm saying?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.325
You know this started when
some CDC employee was like,

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:02.295
"Uh, honey, it's not what you
think. It's a work project."

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.331
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.901
Yeah, they're offering
a bunch of features for users

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.836
who get the vaccine,
like being able to add

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.472
an "I'm vaccinated" badge
to their profile.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.008
[ Laughter ]
Americans are like,

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.210
"Ooh, that's even hotter
than being verified on Twitter."

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.011
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:20.179
"That's hot."

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:26.552
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.421
"That's hot."

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.823
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:33.259
N-B.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.027
That's my new jam.
-Oh, cool.

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:37.230
-N-B?
-N-B, yeah.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.732
-No biggie?
-Yeah, you don't say D anymore.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.334
-You don't say N-B-D?
You just go N-B?

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.570
-No, "no big deal" -- too long.
-Right.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.373
-N-B-D. N-B-D. Fine.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.875
N-B.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:49.942
There you go.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:52.044
Check, please.
-That's sharp, yeah.

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:53.412
-Right?
-I feel hipper.

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:54.781
-That's...

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.915
That's hot.

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.516
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.986
N-B.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.855
The dating sites are also adding
a lot of other helpful badges

00:02:02.855 --> 00:02:05.391
too, like "actually six feet
tall."

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.194
-Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.229
-That'll work.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.431
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.598
Prove it!

00:02:12.598 --> 00:02:14.533
Stand next to something.

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.303
Stand next to something
that's six feet tall. Yeah.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.805
-It's a giant fire hydrant.

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:23.109
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:26.613
-Also they have the badge,
"This is a recent photo."

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.280
Yeah, yeah. I want to know.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:31.116
Yeah, I want to know,
is this a recent photo?

00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:34.420
Then there's also the badge, of
course, "Not a serial killer."

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.123
And that's good
if you know that.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:39.525
Also for the weirdos
who post group photos

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:41.461
on their dating profile,
they offer,

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.828
"I'm the second one
from the right."

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.363
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:46.966
"I know.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.634
I know it's a group photo,

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:51.037
but it's a good one of me,
so I'm going to post it.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.739
I mean, look who else you could
have been stuck with.

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:56.575
My other friends are disasters."

00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:59.078
Speaking of vaccinations, I saw
that people will soon be able

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:02.315
to get their vaccine shots
at airports like LaGuardia.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.750
