"I'm flying through LaGuardia.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:09.856
You think I care about living?"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.924
"I just ate a cold hot dog
and flat soda."

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:14.494
